    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/9743e65c-5a37-402e-88a2-6a96879cd3e8.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.07361in;height:2.09375in\" /></p><p><math><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi></mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Also <math><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>X</mi></math><br /><math><mn>16</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi></mi><mi></mi><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mn>36</mn></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mn>52</mn></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#8901;</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>26</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;units</p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML